WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
This month, Elder Danyangzi has been giving instructions to his disciples about chain body

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,680
Senior sister Duanmu comes every day to arrange the necessary instructions for the disciples.

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:14,420
The disciples dare not hide the truth from the elders and marry two people.

4
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,260
Elder Danyangzi?

5
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,980
Yes, Elder Danyangzi also intends to accept disciples

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,860
Disciples dare not hide it, lest misunderstandings arise in the future

7
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,620
You are a teacher, Shaodian

8
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,940
This kid is actually taken seriously by Danyangzi

9
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:28,820
It's also good, if you can borrow Cizi to have a relationship with Danyangzi,

10
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,220
It’s more interesting than accepting a named disciple.

11
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,100
So that's it

12
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,900
Since Elder Danyangzi has this intention,

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,980
I won’t interfere anymore.

14
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:40,300
Being able to see the elder Danyangzi in person

15
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,500
It's your creation

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,170
Just seize this opportunity well

17
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:45,410
Thank you elder for your understanding
